    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental Defender  is a tower defense game using card to power up your units.  Build your deck and place powerful units to defend your base from passing enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purpose of this game is to defend your base from enemies passing through the path. By placing the unit on the field, unit will attack the enemy in the range.\u00a0 Unit can be powered up by using\u00a0 cards before placing the unit.\u00a0 Placing units and using cards requires energy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Energy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397450/extras/1efc71e898cf85d98db2734d1e535f21.avif?t=1737088356\" width=800 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left bottom circle shows the energy you can use in this wave (upper number) and maximum energy (bottom number).\u00a0 In each wave energy will be reset to the\u00a0maximum\u00a0energy.\u00a0 You can play cards and place units within a energy.\u00a0 The number in the top left corner of a unit card and the playable card is the energy required to use it.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are cards that increases the\u00a0maximum energy and the energy.\u00a0 By increasing the energy, there will be more things you can do within the wave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Element</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each units and the enemies have elements.\u00a0 When unit attacks the enemies, damage will increases or decreases depends\u00a0 of the element of unit and enemy.\u00a0 You can check the effect in the unit status.\u00a0 For example, if the unit is thunder, damage will increase by 150% against ice and 120% against fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397450/extras/acf097f0ffdb114461e117cf4fa74f02.avif?t=1737088356\" width=442 height=192 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unit has three basic status and they are attack, range and speed.\u00a0 Attack  is a number that indicates how much damage you can inflict on an enemy.\u00a0\u00a0Range indicates how far a unit can attack. It will be shown when you are placing unit by blue circle. Speed is the interval between attack.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397450/extras/7cb377ecef87553b38890248b9672791.avif?t=1737088356\" width=414 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some unit has skill or special.\u00a0Skill is the permanent effect that unit owns. It will be automatically effected. Special\u00a0can be activated after a unit has attacked a certain number of times. You can ether play special manually or automatically and can be set in settings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop you can purchase items, cards, and additional units.\u00a0As you progress through the stages, more units will become available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage, you can select the difficulty level.\u00a0 Easy mode, you will obtain a random item every 5 waves.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental Defender  is a tower defense game using card to power up your units.  Build your deck and place powerful units to defend your base from passing enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purpose of this game is to defend your base from enemies passing through the path. By placing the unit on the field, unit will attack the enemy in the range.\u00a0 Unit can be powered up by using\u00a0 cards before placing the unit.\u00a0 Placing units and using cards requires energy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Energy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397450/extras/1efc71e898cf85d98db2734d1e535f21.avif?t=1737088356\" width=800 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left bottom circle shows the energy you can use in this wave (upper number) and maximum energy (bottom number).\u00a0 In each wave energy will be reset to the\u00a0maximum\u00a0energy.\u00a0 You can play cards and place units within a energy.\u00a0 The number in the top left corner of a unit card and the playable card is the energy required to use it.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are cards that increases the\u00a0maximum energy and the energy.\u00a0 By increasing the energy, there will be more things you can do within the wave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Element</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each units and the enemies have elements.\u00a0 When unit attacks the enemies, damage will increases or decreases depends\u00a0 of the element of unit and enemy.\u00a0 You can check the effect in the unit status.\u00a0 For example, if the unit is thunder, damage will increase by 150% against ice and 120% against fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397450/extras/acf097f0ffdb114461e117cf4fa74f02.avif?t=1737088356\" width=442 height=192 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unit has three basic status and they are attack, range and speed.\u00a0 Attack  is a number that indicates how much damage you can inflict on an enemy.\u00a0\u00a0Range indicates how far a unit can attack. It will be shown when you are placing unit by blue circle. Speed is the interval between attack.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397450/extras/7cb377ecef87553b38890248b9672791.avif?t=1737088356\" width=414 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some unit has skill or special.\u00a0Skill is the permanent effect that unit owns. It will be automatically effected. Special\u00a0can be activated after a unit has attacked a certain number of times. You can ether play special manually or automatically and can be set in settings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop you can purchase items, cards, and additional units.\u00a0As you progress through the stages, more units will become available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage, you can select the difficulty level.\u00a0 Easy mode, you will obtain a random item every 5 waves.</p>",
